    Because MDT is 6 hours behind GMT, finding live overlap windows requires scheduling meetings in European afternoons and North American mornings.
  </p>

  <div class="custom-svg-container" style="margin: 1.5rem 0; border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--panel);">
